  "diagnostics": [
    "The Windows/WSL troubleshooting note is preserved as a block constraint on setup_mcp_commands; it is not modeled as a separate execution path.",
    "Practical Workflows are represented as selection options in the select_linear_workflow metadata; the selected workflow drives the generic read/plan/write/summarize path.",
    "Tips for Maximum Productivity and Troubleshooting sections are non-executable guidance and were not modeled as behavior blocks.",
    "agents/openai.yaml declares the Linear MCP dependency; this is represented by the external_resource identifier linear_mcp_server.",
    "License and asset files are non-executable and were not modeled as behavior blocks."
  ]
